# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Citing this package {#citing-this-package}"
msgstr "Pagsipi sa package na ito {#citing-this-package}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you use this package in your research, use the [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) file in this project’s repository to cite the appropriate reference(s).\n"
msgstr "Kung gagamitin mo ang package na ito sa iyong pananaliksik, gamitin ang file na [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) sa repository ng proyektong ito para sipiin ang naaangkop na reference.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Acknowledgements {#acknowledgements}"
msgstr "Mga pasasalamat {#acknowledgements}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package includes an optional sampling strategy within the self-consistent configuration recovery loop that trims determinants based on intermediate diagonalization results. The implementation is based on joint research from the Cleveland Clinic Foundation, RIKEN, and IBM. If you use this feature in your research, please also use the citation for the paper, which can be found in the [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) file with citation key `merz2026crossing`. An implementation of the full workflow from that paper is expected to be available on GitHub soon.\n"
msgstr "Kasama sa package na ito ang isang opsyonal na sampling strategy sa loob ng self-consistent configuration recovery loop na nagtatrim ng mga determinant batay sa mga resulta ng intermediate diagonalization. Ang implementasyon ay batay sa magkasanib na pananaliksik ng Cleveland Clinic Foundation, RIKEN, at IBM. Kung gagamitin mo ang feature na ito sa iyong pananaliksik, gamitin din ang citation para sa paper, na makikita sa file na [CITATION.bib](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-addon-sqd/blob/main/CITATION.bib) na may citation key na `merz2026crossing`. Inaasahang malapit nang magamit sa GitHub ang implementasyon ng buong workflow mula sa paper na iyon.\n"

