# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation Policy {#deprecation-policy}"
msgstr "Patakaran sa Deprecation {#deprecation-policy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We follow [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). We may occasionally make breaking changes in order to improve the user experience. When possible, we will keep old interfaces and mark them as deprecated, as long as they can co-exist with the new ones. Each substantial improvement, breaking change, or deprecation will be documented in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/release-notes).\n"
msgstr "Sinusunod namin ang [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/). Paminsan-minsan, maaari kaming gumawa ng mga breaking change para mapabuti ang karanasan ng user. Kung posible, pananatilihin namin ang mga lumang interface at mamarkahan ang mga ito bilang deprecated, hangga't maaari silang magkasabay sa mga bago. Idodokumento ang bawat malaking pagpapabuti, breaking change, o deprecation sa [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-addon-sqd/release-notes).\n"

